  "fullContentHtml": "<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 225px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%; text-align: center; height: 36px; border-style: none;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Name Of Post :</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%; height: 36px; border-style: none;\">\n<h1><strong>Atal Bihari Vajpayee Medical University ABVMU UP CNET Counselling 2026</strong></h1>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%; text-align: center; height: 35px; border-style: none;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Post Date / Update :</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%; height: 35px; border-style: none;\">15 June 2026&nbsp; | 12:57 PM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 154px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%; text-align: center; height: 154px; border-style: none;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information </strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%; height: 154px; border-style: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Atal Bihari Vajpayee Medical University (ABVMU), Uttar Pradesh has released the UP Common Nursing Entrance Test UPCNET Notification 2026. Those Candidates are Interested to the Following Exam Can Apply Online From 28/03/2026 to 20/05/2026.candidates should read the UPCNET 2026 information brochure for all the information related to the UPCNET exam like syllabus, eligibility, age limit, fees, B.SC Nursing, Post B.SC Nursing and M.Sc Nursing Courses, information and other types of information and then apply.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"social-grid\">\n\n<div class=\"social-box telegram\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2111/2111646.png\">\n        <span>Telegram</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://t.me/SarkariResult2012\" class=\"social-btn\">Join Us</a>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"social-box whatsapp\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/733/733585.png\">\n        <span>WhatsApp</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://www.whatsapp.com/channel/0029Va5IElwBlHpVBd6i5a18\" class=\"social-btn\">Join Us</a>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"social-box instagram\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2111/2111463.png\">\n        <span>Instagram</span>\n    </div>\n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"social-box twitter\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/5968/5968958.png\">\n        <span>X</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://x.com/srofficial2012\" class=\"social-btn\">Follow</a>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div id=\"v-sarkariresult\"></div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-48617a69 gb-headline-text\"><table border=\"1\" width=\"718\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Atal Bihari Vajpayee Medical University (<b>ABVMU)</b>, Uttar Pradesh</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Uttar Pradesh Common Nursing Entrance Test CNET 2026</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>UP CNET Exam 2026: Short Details of Notification</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b></b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"341\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Application Begin :<b>28/03/2026</b></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>20/05/2026</b></span></li>\n<li>Pay Exam Fee Last Date :<b>20/05/2026</b></li>\n<li>Correction Date :<b>13-20 May 2026</b></li>\n<li>UPCNET 2026 Exam Date :<b>06 June 2026</b></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available &nbsp;:<b> 31/05/2026</b></li>\n<li>Answer Key Available : <strong>09/06/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Result Date : <strong>13/06/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Counselling Start Date : <strong>14/06/2026</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"377\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>General / OBC / EWS: <b>3000/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST / PH : <b>2000/-</b></li>\n<li>Pay the Exam Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking Only.</li>\n<li>Counselling Registration Fee : <strong>500/- (NON-Refundable)</strong></li>\n<li>Counselling Security Fee : <strong>5000/-</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>UP Common Nursing Admission Test 2026 : </b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Age Limit as on 31/12/2026</b></span></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age : <b>17 Years.</b></li>\n<li>Age Relaxation Details Read the UP Common Nursing CNET 2026 Rules.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>UP CNET 2026 Entrance Exam : </b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Admissions Details</b></span></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"203\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Course Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"515\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>UPCNET 2026 Eligibility</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"203\">\n<p align=\"center\">B.SC Nursing 4 Years</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"515\">\n<ul>\n<li>10+2 Intermediate with PCB Subject and Passed in English Individually from Any Recognized Board.</li>\n<li>Minimum 45% Marks.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"203\">\n<p align=\"center\">Post B.SC Nursing Course 2 Years</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"515\">\n<ul>\n<li>10+2 Intermediate Exam from Any Recognized Board in India.</li>\n<li>GNM Certificate and Registered as State Nurses Registration Council.</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"203\">\n<p align=\"center\">M.SC Nursing / Nurse Practitioner in Critical Care NPCC 2 Years</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"515\">\n<ul>\n<li>Registered Nurse and Registered Midwife with Any Nursing Registration Council.</li>\n<li>B.SC Nursing / Post Basic B.Sc Nursing with 55% Marks.</li>\n<li>1 Year Work Experience Clinical OR Teaching After Basic B.SC Nursing</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Uttar Pradesh CNET 2026 : Participating Institute / University</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>All Nursing Colleges Affiliated to ABVMU</li>\n<li>SGPGIMS, Lucknow</li>\n<li>KGMU, Lucknow</li>\n<li>RMLIMS, Lucknow</li>\n<li>UPUMS, Saifai</li>\n<li>LLRM, Meerut</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\"><center><br>\n<!-- 300 x 250 mar 23 --><br>\n<br>\n</center><p></p>\n\n<ul>\n<li><b>Cast Certificate Instruction :</b> &nbsp;OBC and EWS certificate should be issued after<b> 01 April 2026.</b></li>\n<li><b>Photo Instruction :</b> The photograph should be full face, from front, with <b>white background</b> and without spectacles along with the <b>name of the candidate and date of photograph</b> should be written on the photograph.</li>\n<li>Uttar Pradesh Common Nursing Entrance Test CNET 2026 Notification Released. Candidate Can Apply From <b>28/03/2026 to 20/05/2026.</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Admission Application Form in Atal Bihari Vajpayee Medical University, ABVMU Lucknow , K.G. Medical University, U.P., KGMU Lucknow, Dr. R.M.L. Institute of Medical Sciences, RML Lucknow, UPUMS and All Govt. &amp; Private Universities / Deemed Universities of U.P</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012).</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Interested Candidate Can Read the Full UP CNET Admission 2026 Notification Before Apply Online.</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"328\">\n\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"390\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"718\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Registration &amp; Choice Filling</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"UP CNET Choice Filling\" href=\"https://www.abvmucet26.co.in/entrance2026/login?form=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2